    "Drive smarter with reports from drivers around you. Gimano needs your location to show where you are and guide you turn by turn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memandu lebih bijak dengan laporan daripada pemandu di sekeliling anda. Gimano memerlukan lokasi anda untuk menunjukkan kedudukan anda dan memandu arah demi arah."
          }
